    <statement><p>Suppose <m>f(x)=ax^2+bx+c\text{,}</m> where <m>a\text{,}</m> <m>b\text{,}</m> and <m>c</m> are constants and <m>a\neq 0\text{.}</m> Find the point where the tangent line is horizontal.</p>
